WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:05.280
Look at us.
看看我们。

2
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:11.200
We're all getting together, jumping on here, and it's our first time seeing each other after our spring break week.
我们聚在一起，连上线，这是我们春假过后的第一次见面。

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.100
Yeah.
对。

4
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:12.560
Yeah.
对。

5
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:13.860
How's everyone feeling?
大家感觉怎么样？

6
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.800
Does everyone feel like real relaxed?
大家都觉得整个人很放松吗？

7
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.500
Yeah, I've definitely slept for a week.
对，我绝对睡了整整一个星期。

8
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.060
Did everybody take a break?
大家都休息了吗？

9
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:19.420
Yeah.
对。

10
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.080
You did?
你休息了吗？

11
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.960
I watched all of The Pit.
我把《深渊》全看完了。

12
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.640
I watched all of White Lotus, all of Righteous Gemstones.
我把《白莲花度假村》和《世纪ghoul》全看完了。

13
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.740
I have two episodes left of The Pit, so don't say a word.
我《深渊》还剩最后两集，所以什么也别说。

14
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.020
Okay, I won't.
好，我不说。

15
00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.280
I won't.
我不说。

16
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.060
It's left of White Lotus, so also please zip it.
《白莲花度假村》也还没看完，所以也请闭嘴。

17
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.440
You're in for a treat.
精彩的还在后头呢。

18
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:37.520
Won't say anything.
什么都不说。

19
00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:37.900
Okay.
好。

20
00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.920
Yeah, I finished it last night.
对，我昨晚看完了。

21
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.720
I just read that it doesn't have the same theme music, the ho, ho, ho, whatever that music is.
我刚看到说它没有那种相同的主题音乐，就是那个“嚯、嚯、嚯”什么的音乐。

22
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:46.840
Each season is different.
每一季都不一样。

23
00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.480
It's slightly different, yeah.
是有些不同，对。

24
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:48.140
Why?
为什么？

25
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.600
I read because they had a falling out, the composer.
我看到是因为他们闹翻了，那个作曲家。

26
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:51.460
Oh, really?
哦，真的吗？

27
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:51.900
Wait, what?
等等，什么？

28
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:52.320
Yes.
是的。

29
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.020
Is that true?
那是真的吗？

30
00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.860
Are you spreading the dish?
你在散布八卦吗？

31
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.200
You guys all went on this real, like, I'm going to step away from...
你们大家都去搞那种，就像是“我要远离……”

32
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.940
Like, social media, and I was like, give it to me.
比如社交媒体，而我就像是在说，快拿来吧。

33
00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:05.480
I'm home.
我到家了。

34
00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:06.780
Give me the gossip.
把八卦告诉我。

35
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.920
You're just scrolling through all the stuff.
你只是在刷所有这些东西。

36
00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:12.980
Also, you went to a very fancy party, Ange.
另外，安吉，你去了一个非常高级的派对。

37
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:13.600
Oh.
哦。

38
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.200
Okay.
好吧。

39
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.900
You guys, I need my...
你们大家，我需要我的……

40
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:19.700
You can tell it's going to be good if she's downplaying it right from the start.
看她从一开始就轻描淡写，就知道这事肯定不简单。

41
00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:22.000
Well, here it is.
好吧，事情是这样的。

42
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:26.900
First of all, I think my license for small talk should be revoked.
首先，我觉得我的闲聊执照该被吊销了。

43
00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:27.240
Why?
为什么？

44
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.500
I don't think I should have small talk.
我觉得我不应该跟人闲聊。

45
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.740
I don't know this story, Angela.
安吉拉，我还不知道这个故事呢。

46
00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.380
No, you guys, I'm juSt...
不，你们大家，我只是……

47
00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.040
I think I'm out of practice.
我觉得我生疏了。

48
00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.300
What did you refer to as being in a candy jar?
你把什么比作糖果罐来着？

49
00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.120
Oh, Sam.
哦，萨姆。

50
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.220
Sam, I wish it was a candy jar.
萨姆，我倒希望那是个糖果罐。

51
00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:45.700
Okay.
好的。

52
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:46.080
Okay.
好吧。

53
00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:48.160
Well, I didn't go anywhere for spring break.
那个，我春假哪里也没去。

54
00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.560
I just stayed home, and I took just kids to doctor's appointments.
我只是呆在家里，带孩子们去看了医生。

55
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:57.340
Everyone got their teeth cleaned, and, you know, Isabel and Jack had their wisdom teeth consultations.
大家都洗了牙，而且，你知道的，伊莎贝尔和杰克去做了智齿咨询。

56
00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:59.580
You did, like, eight doctor's appointments, I think.
我觉得你大概跑了八趟医院吧。

57
00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.020
I went and got my yearly woman's exam.
我自己去做了年度妇科检查。

58
00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:02.400
Good.
不错。

59
00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:03.340
Good.
很好。

60
00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:03.980
Good job.
干得好。

61
00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:04.240
Yay.
太棒了。

62
00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:04.860
I did it.
我做到了。

63
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:05.240
Okay.
好吧。

64
00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:11.020
So, I did all of that kind of, like, you know, tending to my garden, if you will.
所以，我基本上就做了那些事，就像是，你知道的，打理我的“花园”，如果你懂我的意思的话。

65
00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:11.580
Sorry.
抱歉。

66
00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:12.860
No, no.
没事，没事。

67
00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.060
That's what you meant.
这才是你的本意。

68
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.140
Take my small talk license.
吊销我的闲聊许可证吧。

69
00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:16.700
Take it away.
收回吧。

70
00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.940
So, I've known Glenn Powell for a long time.
所以，我认识格伦·鲍威尔很久了。

71
00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:25.140
Jen and I met him together years ago at, like, an award show party.
多年前，詹和我是在某个颁奖典礼的派对上一起认识他的。

72
00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:26.140
He was so nice.
他人超级好。

73
00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:26.620
Such a nice guy.
真是个好人。

74
00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.520
He's the handsome actor from Twisters?
就是那个演《龙卷风》的帅气演员吗？

75
00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:29.560
Yes.
对。

76
00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:29.760
Okay.
好。

77
00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:30.500
Correct.
没错。

78
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:35.140
And he's also from Texas, and we sort of did that, like, oh, you're from Texas, I'm from Texas.
而且他也来自德州，所以我们当时就那种，哦，你来自德州，我也来自德州。

79
00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:42.220
And we exchange information, and, like, every once in a while, over the years, we'll just check in with each other, like, hey, how's it going?
然后我们交换了联系方式，多年来，就隔三差五地互相问候一下，比如，嘿，最近怎么样？

80
00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.540
Or congrats on this.
或者恭喜你得了这个。

81
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.260
Or he'll invite me to something, or I'll invite him to something.
或者他会邀请我去参加什么活动，或者我邀请他。

82
00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:49.160
And he's just such a great guy.
他真的是个超级棒的人。

83
00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:59.420
So, I see online, because, you know, I'm home scrolling, that he has a new line of condiments, like condiments made with organic ingredients, and it's called Smash Kitchen.
然后我上网时看到，因为你知道嘛，我在家刷手机，看到他推出了一系列新的调味品，是用有机成分制作的调味品，叫做“Smash Kitchen”。

84
00:02:59.780 --> 00:02:59.960
Okay?
是吧？

85
00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.020
And I just DM'd him, like, hey, this is fantastic.
然后我就私信他说，嘿，这太棒了。

86
00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:08.820
Congratulations.
恭喜呀。

87
00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:10.400
And he's like, thanks so much.
他说，非常感谢。

88
00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:12.480
He's like, are you in town this week?
他说，你这周在城里吗？

89
00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.120
I'm going to have a little thing to celebrate it.
我要办个小型活动来庆祝一下。

90
00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:15.780
Are you around?
你有空吗？

91
00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.400
And I said, I am.
我说，我有空。

92
00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:22.180
And I'm thinking to myself, oh, my gosh, we didn't really do much over spring break.
我当时心里想，天哪，我们春假其实也没怎么出去玩。

93
00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.140
This is going to make Isabel's day, because she is such a big fan.
这绝对会让伊莎贝尔高兴坏的，因为她是他的超级粉丝。

94
00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:29.040
So, I text him, and I say, I can come.
于是我发信息告诉他，我可以去。

95
00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:30.000
Can I bring my daughter?
我能带我女儿一起去吗？

96
00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:32.420
And he's like, absolutely, that would be amazing.
他说，当然可以，那太棒了。

97
00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.800
Because, like, you know, his parents are going.
因为，你知道的，他的父母也会去。

98
00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.340
This is like a family affair.
这就像是一场家庭聚会。

99
00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:42.540
There's going to be wonderful barbecue and lots of good dipping sauces.
会有美味的烧烤和许多好吃的沾酱。

100
00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:47.680
Anyway, I tell Isabel, and she loses her mind.
总之，我把这事告诉伊莎贝尔后，她激动得快疯了。

101
00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.040
And can I tell you guys what I wore?
我能跟你们讲讲我穿了什么吗？

102
00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.380
Yes, of course you can say what you wore.
可以，你当然可以说说你穿了什么。

103
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:52.600
Yes.
好。

104
00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.160
Try to chit-chat.
试着聊聊天。

105
00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.160
Thank you, Sam.
谢谢你，萨姆。

106
00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:57.340
I wore a sweater I got at the mall ages ago.
我穿了一件很久以前在商场买的毛衣。

107
00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.460
Like, at a little, you know, the little pop-up kiosk in the middle of the mall?
就像那种，你知道的，商场中间的小型快闪摊位？

108
00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.120
Yeah.
对。

109
00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.080
I couldn't even tell you.
我甚至都说不上来。

110
00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.160
Like, it was just one of those randos I bought.
就像是我随便买的其中一件一样。

111
00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.200
And then I wore my tennis shorts.
然后我穿了网球短裤。

112
00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.000
Love it.
太棒了。

113
00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.860
You guys, I wore tennis shorts.
伙计们，我穿了网球短裤。

114
00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.140
That's on brand for you.
这很符合你的风格。

115
00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:12.660
It's great.
太棒了。

116
00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.140
I know.
我知道。

117
00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.740
But I was like, well, I don't know.
但我当时想，嗯，我不知道。

118
00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.660
You looked adorable, by the way.
顺便说一句，你看起来太可爱了。

119
00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:17.620
Thank you.
谢谢。

120
00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.320
I did my own hair and makeup.
我自己弄了发型和妆容。

121
00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.900
And Isabel and I go, she's so tickled.
然后我和伊莎贝尔去了，她特别高兴。

122
00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:22.800
We go really early.
我们去得特别早。

123
00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.360
We're like the first people there.
我们就像是到那儿的第一批人。

124
00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:25.860
You guys, it started at 7.
伙计们，活动7点开始。

125
00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:27.340
We arrived at 7.08.
我们7点08分到了。

126
00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:29.120
This is so us now.
这太像现在的我们了。

127
00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:31.360
I know.
我知道。

128
00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:35.460
And I said, Isabel, we're just going to stay two hours because we wanted to get back home
我说，伊莎贝尔，我们只待两个小时，因为我们想回家

129
00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:39.560
and, you know, be able to, like, hang out and watch a movie and stuff.
然后，你知道的，能够像那样待着看个电影什么的。

130
00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.480
So, there's not a lot of people there at that time.
所以，那个时间人还不多。

131
00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:43.940
I mean, a ton of people showed up.
我的意思是，后来来了超级多的人。

132
00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:44.560
Don't get me wrong.
别误会我的意思。

133
00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:48.080
I just want to point out, arriving at 7.08 to something at 7 p.m.
我只想指出，晚上7点开始的活动，7点08分到达

134
00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.660
in Los Angeles is the
在洛杉矶，就等同于

135
00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.760
same as arriving two hours early anywhere else in the country.
在全国其他任何地方提前两个小时到达。

136
00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:53.140
Absolutely.
绝对是的。

137
00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:53.380
I know.
我知道。

138
00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.580
Well, anyway, it was so cute.
嗯，不管怎样，太可爱了。

139
00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:01.580
It was at this fancy, fancy, like, estate with, like, the view of the whole city, like, that
活动在一个非常非常豪华的庄园举行，能看到整个城市的风景，就那种

140
00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:02.140
kind of thing.
地方。

141
00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.540
And there was cornhole.
而且还有扔沙包游戏。

142
00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:07.540
So, me and Isabel played cornhole while we waited for people to get there.
所以，我和伊莎贝尔一边等别人到一边玩扔沙包。

143
00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:12.540
And then there was, like, a French fry, like, stand with all the different dipping sauces.
然后还有一个炸薯条摊，有各种不同的蘸酱。

144
00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:15.460
Jenna, you know how much I love dipping sauces.
珍娜，你知道我多喜欢蘸酱。

145
00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.860
This was heaven for me.
这对我来说简直是天堂。

146
00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:17.940
I assume they're his dipping sauces.
我猜那是他的蘸酱。

147
00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:18.680
And so, we're hanging out.
然后，我们就到处闲逛。

148
00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:19.860
Of course.
当然。

149
00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:20.340
Yes.
对。

150
00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.140
Well, of course.
嗯，当然。

151
00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:21.880
Okay.
好吧。

152
00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.980
How many missteps can you make in one conversation?
一场对话里你能犯多少错误？

153
00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.680
And he was so kind.
而且他真的太好了。

154
00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:27.580
Bless his heart.
真是个好人。

155
00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:31.280
So, he sees us from across this area.
然后，他在那片区域的另一头看到了我们。

156
00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.460
People are around him.
他周围都是人。

157
00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.000
And he makes a face like, hey!
然后他做了个表情，就像在打招呼！

158
00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.500
Like, that super, like, hey, I've seen a friend.
那种超级热情地打招呼，就好像，嘿，我看到朋友了。

159
00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:37.520
I was like, oh, yay!
我当时想，哦，太棒了！

160
00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:41.200
And Isabel's like, mom, can I please just get one picture with him?
伊莎贝尔就说，妈妈，我能求你帮我和他合一张影吗？

161
00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:41.940
I was like, yes, honey.
我说，行啊，亲爱的。

162
00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:42.880
We will make it happen.
我们会办到的。

163
00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.200
So, we go up and we're chatting with him.
于是，我们走过去和他聊天。

164
00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.360
And he's so nice.
他真的太友好了。

165
00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:48.940
Thankfully, it was loud.
幸好当时很吵。

166
00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.020
So, I don't think he heard me.
所以，我觉得他没听见我说的。

167
00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:53.120
But I said, congratulations on Smashed Kitchen.
但我却说，恭喜你的《粉碎厨房》开播。

168
00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.400
This is so great.
这太棒了。

169
00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:58.660
It's Smashed Kitchen.
那是《粉碎厨房》。

170
00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:05.120
